### Register Measurements (batch) for an Evaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "measurements": [
    { "measurementTypeId": "{{measurementTypeId}}", "value": 33.0 }
  ]
}

###

### List Measurements for an Evaluation
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}/measurements
